{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1000_p", "source_sha256": "57e4b2e3704488e26e1976e7e4dc6d3c31025f1b365c7e4e6b0066af43b8d9e1", "ja": "（今日は歩の新衣装の試着……なんだが。\nさっきから歩は、カーテンの裏に隠れてて出てこない）", "zh": "（今天要试穿步的新服装……是这样没错。\n可是步从刚才起就一直躲在帘子后面，不肯出来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c10b5f4beba2a35ad92c08383ad231a2876214d9db6c649b9527ee01a45f3423", "ja": "ねぇ{$P$}……本当に見せなきゃ\nダメ？　サイズ感は大丈夫なんだけど……。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}……真的非得给你看不可吗？尺寸大小倒是没问题，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1002_p", "source_sha256": "61cb9d20b69a6560b0a7fd489ec0a0bbf4caab1a1eafb4b46e4b128612e6a2be", "ja": "そう言われても、確認しないわけにもいかないし。\n観念して、出てきたらどうだ？", "zh": "你这么说，我也不能不确认啊。认命吧，出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9a8a6eaa517407f49a68bdd7ee67cea0421efafbb4978608d414a3ddb1bfe781", "ja": "わ、わかったよ……。", "zh": "我、我知道了啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cac21d4d0e0360f90367bffe947034058fcadc16437a392446679db9987ecbfa", "ja": "ああ～、どうしよう。やっぱり落ち着かない～！", "zh": "啊啊～怎么办才好。果然还是静不下来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "96f29cb9b5718ef212fe42571fabef9e149ab3f7063a5c5e9d9cbbeefed257e0", "ja": "まさか、こんなガーリーな衣装だなんて……。\n他の子のと間違えてない？　本当にアタシの？", "zh": "真没想到，居然是这么少女风的服装……\n没跟其他人的搞错吧？真的是给我的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a98282cef87c57bb94739b7f68ea57e5963b7b0c531a277dfba6d3799b71da8d", "ja": "もちろん！　歩はカッコイイ衣装やアクティブな衣装が\n多いから、正統派な可愛い衣装を用意したんだけど……", "zh": "当然了！因为步平时的服装多是帅气\n或者有活力的风格，所以才准备了正统派的可爱服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1007_p", "source_sha256": "eab9a60c522a7d2b310c0285fe102be59f87780fa7c3374bde15d4a8f436ba0a", "ja": "もしかして、嫌だったか？", "zh": "难道你不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a84bdab01029a52004d4e72f06b63759b8844660f088f63c8c07bc0b597b6422", "ja": "ううん！　嫌とかじゃないよ、全然。\nそうなんだよ、今までの衣装と比べるとさ……。", "zh": "没有啦！完全不是讨厌哦。\n只是啊，跟之前的服装比起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e99e1f83c3b17ddc4fe45b55f5d3946e92edac536d12579bad48645e0ec40023", "ja": "こんなにも可愛い！って感じ、初めてでしょ？\nだからこう……ソワソワしちゃって。", "zh": "这种“居然这么可爱！”的感觉，还是第一次吧？所以就……有点坐立不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f66d5f004e8634dd99941735d9bffc23b9283a74ff175ef854165037abf6f6be", "ja": "髪も下ろしてるし……。\nだ、大丈夫？　跳ねてたりしない？", "zh": "头发也放下来了……大、没问题吧？没有翘起来之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6c5419630e72446a3ba82f6fcf411bed4566709307c0cbdb9f68e87577b2aee5", "ja": "大丈夫だって、衣装も髪型もすごく可愛い。\nよく似合ってるよ、歩！", "zh": "都说了没问题的，服装和发型都非常可爱。\n很适合你哦，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "198cbd40d893aa78cd8cfd6e5a3ac4c6f44a0849b1acefe0e68c61e3476a02da", "ja": "そ、そういう感想を面と向かって言うのもさ～……！\nまぁ、うれしいのは、うれしいんだけど……。", "zh": "当、当着面说这种感想什么的～……！\n嘛，开心是开心啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0ff792fe3463f15311fb130d9c17ac954c7f8c7db4cfcd3ef864019f397f6fe6", "ja": "ただアタシ、自分にはこういう、いかにもな\n可愛い衣装は似合わないと思ってたから……。", "zh": "只是我一直觉得，这种一看就很可爱的服装不适合自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c574ee2b3ccb99e4d154d32130c60d687cbd1dd1c40cde881509a0fa69281ad7", "ja": "着てみたら、意外と悪くないかも？って思ったんだけど\n……慣れてないせいか、なんか恥ずかしいんだよ～！", "zh": "穿上试了试，觉得意外地好像也不赖？不过……可能是因为还没习惯，总觉得有点害羞啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5b242f9cd880440bce619b409f6e13a64ddbbe633ecbb5038f0f7ada88d8b3b5", "ja": "だからこそプロデューサーの俺が、\n歩の新しい一面を切り開いた、ってところかな？", "zh": "正因为如此，作为制作人的我，算是发掘出了步全新的一面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "61ceee2420da46362a9cea98a5af25792793d160231f8a20d1e81d5e7d3868bb", "ja": "もう、他人事だと思って！\n……でも、{$P$}の言うとおりだよ。", "zh": "真是的，站着说话不腰疼！\n……不过，确实正如{$P$}说的那样啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "06128a1f6019c81b97df1f1b677e298135a12fb1d7b136d74d873429eaa0135e", "ja": "アタシひとりだったら、こんなガーリーな衣装、\n絶対に挑戦しなかったと思う。だから……。", "zh": "如果只有我一个人的话，我肯定不会挑战这么少女风的服装。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "64665167cb54d1f6bf7d7eea36b71317040cdedfe6578defec7ebfc09d4f3ba0", "ja": "その……新しい衣装、着せてくれてありがと。\n{$P$}……。", "zh": "那个……谢谢你让我穿上这么新颖的服装。\n{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0304_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e6b402195b09fdef7af5680f55ab09594eaf2a6e95befe0c7120acf38d5a5457", "ja": "どういたしまして。\n新しい衣装での仕事も、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "不用客气。\n穿着新衣服的工作也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
